s": [], "flag": 0, "createTime": 1754492112, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300024943", "format": "epub", "version": 1120411252, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/43/3300024943/s_3300024943.jpg", "title": "一句顶一万句（2022新版）", "author": "刘震云", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 14, "chapterTitle": "十一", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}, {"reviewId": "17408780_82cr2UN5d", "review": {"bookId": "3300024943", "content": "这才是艺术的魅力，可以挑动人的神经，引起某种共鸣。另外，艺术一定是因人而异的。晋剧对于老鲁是艺术，对其他人就不一定是，艺术不可强求。", "bookVersion": 1703608050, "range": "7391-7628", "abstract": "老鲁本是延津人，按说喜欢戏，也该喜欢河南梆子，但他和新任县长老史一样，不喜欢河南梆子，喜欢外地戏。老鲁当年去内蒙古卖砖茶，常常从山西路过，听些晋剧。一开始他并不喜欢听戏，不但不喜欢河南梆子，也不喜欢晋剧。但听着听着，晋剧唱起来，可着嗓门往外吼，不吼到破锣嗓子，不算唱到兴处；到了兴处，破着嗓子又像钢丝一样，往上拐一个弯和挑一个高。不是破锣嗓子与自己有些相仿，老鲁才喜欢；而是到了兴处，又拐个弯和挑个高，不知撞到了老鲁心里的哪一块，这一块过去没发现，现在发现了，从此落下病根。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 54, "reviewId": "17408780_82cr2UN5d", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1754470455, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300024943", "format": "epub", "version": 1120411252, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/43/3300024943/s_3300024943.jpg", "title": "一句顶一万句（2022新版）", "author": "刘震云", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 13, "chapterTitle": "十", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}, {"reviewId": "17408780_82c3irI4R", "review": {"bookId": "3300024943", "content": "办个事，我思考了，你没思考，执行过程与预期之间马上就出现差距，思考过的人就会不接受这个差距，特别是在职场。", "bookVersion": 1703608050, "range": "7255-7374", "abstract": "譬如在染坊，一句平常话，他得想半天；虽然想了半天，放到嘴里说出来，还是一句平常话。别人认为是平常话，但老蒋经过了想，认为这话就不平常了；如果你还按平常话去办，老蒋就急了。杨百顺到蒋家之后，老蒋看了他一眼，低下头想。小宋在旁边帮杨百顺说话：", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 53, "reviewId": "17408780_82c3irI4R", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1754448698, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300024943", "format": "epub", "version": 1120411252, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/43/3300024943/s_3300024943.jpg", "title": "一句顶一万句（2022新版）", "author": "刘震云", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 12, "chapterTitle": "九", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}], "totalCount": 6}}